Sokha's sister works in a hotel. She is an employee in the reception team. She does shift work, so sometimes she starts at six in the morning. Her boss is kind, and her team leader helps her a lot. The hotel has a uniform policy. Last month, she went on a training course. Her day off is Monday. Her father will retire next year.

